OL,3,GNEWSAFire boss thanks staff and public
OL,4,Ain open letter
OL,5,
OL,6,FTuhill said the "unprecedented demand"
OL,7,Fhad taken a "physical and emotional
OL,8,Ftoll" on firefighters who worked in
OL,9,Fextreme heat and control staff who
OL,10,Fdealt with a constant stream of calls.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
